WEBVTT

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.780
Huh?!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.949
Wh-What are...?

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.534
Layfon-<i>kun</i>...

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.869
Mr. President...

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.454
Layfon-<i>kun</i>...

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.705
Mr. President!

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.958
You can't escape... Layfon-<i>kun</i>.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:46.004
Mr. President... Why am I here, in this place?

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:52.635
Layfon-<i>kun</i>... I... You... Yes, <i>you</i>...!

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.059
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.604
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:10.028
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.784
<i>Chizu o ushinatte samayotteiru machi</i>

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:19.245
<i>Owariyuku sekai demo</i>

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:25.960
<i>Karada no oku de hashiru no o yamenai inochi o</i>
<i>kikasete</i>

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.255
<i>Tayasanai hikari o tozasanai hitomi ni</i>

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.592
<i>Kawaitemo yakitsuketa</i>

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:39.224
<i>Kizutsuku koto mo naku te ni</i>
<i>suru mono nante nanimo shinjinai</i>

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:45.146
<i>Dareka ni mukatta hitosuji no omoi wa</i>

00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:53.029
<i>Yoake no you ni hagane no yami o kirisaku</i>

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:57.367
<i>Itsuka brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:01.037
<i>Dakara tsuyoku kaeru</i>

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:07.002
<i>Kasaneta chikara mo inori mo</i>

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:10.672
<i>Kousa suru mirai, kakaeta negai</i>

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:14.050
<i>Dare no te ni mo watasenai</i>

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.593
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:15.593 --> 00:02:20.598
<i>Kokoro o tsuraneru</i>

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.857
<i>Why</i>?

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.651
<i>Why</i>?

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.278
<i>Why</i>?

00:02:34.029 --> 00:02:37.365
<i>Why am I in a place like this</i>?

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.618
Yesterday was such an ordeal!

00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:43.455
I collapsed in the Student Council
Room in the midst of my duties.

00:02:43.455 --> 00:02:45.290
Mr. President!

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:48.043
Mr. President!!

00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:52.005
The doctor says it appears to be overwork.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:57.552
Still, it seems I'll recover if
I rest easy for two to three days.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:02.807
Yes... And...

00:03:02.807 --> 00:03:08.730
<i>Why</i>? Why did I have to come here as well?!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.439
Today and tomorrow are R&amp;R days.

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:10.899
"Spa Resort Kalian"
Today and tomorrow are R&amp;R days.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.068
"Spa Resort Kalian"
There isn't any training, is there?

00:03:13.068 --> 00:03:18.698
It was the perfect chance for
a brother-sister getaway, just us two.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:19.949
Ow!

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.785
Mr. President!

00:03:24.829 --> 00:03:27.248
This is pointless.

00:03:39.678 --> 00:03:40.804
"Helli"
Was that...?

00:03:45.266 --> 00:03:49.270
Oh! Felli! Well isn't <i>this </i>a coincidence?!

00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:51.898
Ma'am...

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:56.945
Well now! That was splendidly done!

00:03:56.945 --> 00:03:59.864
<i>Huh</i>? It's Felli!!

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.491
Senior Felli.

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:03.618
Fon-Fon...

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:05.662
What is this?

00:04:05.662 --> 00:04:09.082
I thought we could all do
something to bond as a team.

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:11.376
Yeah! Bond!

00:04:11.376 --> 00:04:13.169
Without <i>me</i>...

00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:14.796
Is that it?

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:17.090
Ah! About that--

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.468
We'd heard the president had collapsed.

00:04:20.468 --> 00:04:23.054
We thought you'd be
having a tough time of it now...

00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:27.142
Yes! Yes, that's right!
That's why we didn't invite you!

00:04:27.142 --> 00:04:29.144
Yeah! Yeah!

00:04:30.729 --> 00:04:33.189
How is the president doing?

00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:35.775
He's resting. <i>Thoroughly</i>.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:39.112
Oh, my! Honestly, Mr. President!

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.948
Hello there, you all!

00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:45.368
I'm jealous...

00:04:46.327 --> 00:04:51.833
Well, well! What a coincidence,
running into you all here!

00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:53.335
I-It really is!

00:04:53.335 --> 00:04:59.382
Oh! Say, Felli... Why don't you
have Nina Antalk teach you to swim?

00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:02.093
Felli's swimming is really quite terrible.

00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:04.512
Why are you suddenly saying this?!

00:05:04.512 --> 00:05:08.558
I think addressing one's
weaknesses is a good thing.

00:05:08.558 --> 00:05:09.934
Indeed!

00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:13.521
Very well! Let's get started right away!

00:05:13.521 --> 00:05:15.982
Do your best, Felli!

00:05:16.775 --> 00:05:17.650
Here!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.401
Got i-- Ah!

00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:18.943
Sorry!

00:05:18.943 --> 00:05:20.862
Leave it to me! Hyaa!

00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:23.490
--Awesome!
--So cool!

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:26.034
So...

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:28.203
Why did you bring that thing?

00:05:28.203 --> 00:05:31.331
"Why?" We will be entering the pool, yes?

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:33.708
Without this, I will sink.

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:37.128
If you just practice, you'll be able to swim.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.256
And why must I practice?

00:05:40.256 --> 00:05:43.385
It's better to be able to swim than to <i>not </i>be
able to, right?

00:05:43.385 --> 00:05:44.469
Why is that?

00:05:44.469 --> 00:05:46.596
Uh, well...

00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:50.100
Ah! For when we're attacked
by the enemy during marine battles!

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.060
I think a marine battle
occurring during either a formal

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.063
or intermunicipal competition
is quite impossible.

00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:57.482
Ah. Uh, well...

00:05:58.608 --> 00:06:00.819
Wait, hang on a second.
I don't think that's the case.

00:06:00.819 --> 00:06:02.278
Looks like she's fighting an uphill battle.

00:06:02.278 --> 00:06:04.030
--For example... Ah! The bathtub!
--An uphill battle?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:09.244
--For when you're in the bathtub!
--Ah! I-I meant, trying to teach Felli to swim!

00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:11.871
Sure looks like a lot of work.

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:13.623
He <i>is </i>here!

00:06:13.623 --> 00:06:14.666
You're right.

00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:18.086
I tell you, my information is on the money!

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:21.172
An amorous summertime adventure!

00:06:21.172 --> 00:06:21.923
Steamy shot!

00:06:21.923 --> 00:06:25.635
It's the summer of the 17th Platoon!

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:29.472
This will get some
sales for the "Weekly Look'N"!

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:33.101
So that's what you're really after, huh?

00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:34.644
No, that's not it!

00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:37.981
It's about female friendship!
Female friendship! Right, May-cchi?

00:06:37.981 --> 00:06:40.608
C'mon, let's go!

00:06:42.777 --> 00:06:44.029
Lay-ton!

00:06:44.029 --> 00:06:45.780
Huh? Hi, guys.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.365
Lay-ton, you're here, too?

00:06:47.365 --> 00:06:48.283
And you all as well?

00:06:48.283 --> 00:06:51.369
Yeah. We thought we'd
all go swimming together.

00:06:51.369 --> 00:06:53.371
Right, May?

00:06:54.622 --> 00:06:57.125
C'mon now, May-cchi!

00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:59.544
Um, I, um...

00:06:59.544 --> 00:07:01.504
I don't think I can--

00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:03.381
Whoa there!

00:07:03.381 --> 00:07:07.635
What are you saying, after you've
come all this way? Go on, May!

00:07:07.635 --> 00:07:09.846
Hey, Mayshen.

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:17.937
I think getting May into a bathing
suit was too much after all.

00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:20.565
No, I totally made the right call!

00:07:20.565 --> 00:07:23.443
My data says Lay-ton
seems like a real dunderhead,

00:07:23.443 --> 00:07:25.862
so we <i>had </i>to go with something like this!

00:07:25.862 --> 00:07:29.824
Oh! May-cchi, why don't you
get Lay-ton to teach you to swim?

00:07:29.824 --> 00:07:33.203
Yes, yes! May, you can't swim, can you?

00:07:33.203 --> 00:07:36.206
And so, Lay-ton, here's May-cchi.

00:07:36.206 --> 00:07:39.209
<i>Take</i>. <i>Care</i>. <i>Of</i>. <i>Her</i>!

00:07:46.174 --> 00:07:48.051
We're countin' on ya, Lay-ton!

00:07:48.051 --> 00:07:49.928
Good luck, May!

00:07:49.928 --> 00:07:51.554
Hey!

00:07:53.598 --> 00:07:55.600
I'm jealous...

00:07:56.518 --> 00:08:00.438
So, the reason why you
have to practice swimming is...

00:08:01.231 --> 00:08:02.816
Put simply...

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:05.110
I will practice.

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:08.738
I will practice!

00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:14.202
Good! Don't bend your knee
when you're kicking your legs.

00:08:14.202 --> 00:08:15.829
Ma'am.

00:08:16.705 --> 00:08:19.124
Good! You're getting better already.

00:08:19.124 --> 00:08:22.419
At any rate, the important
thing is to get used to the water.

00:08:22.419 --> 00:08:25.839
Next, let's try getting your face in the water.

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:29.217
Okay, let's try moving your legs next.

00:08:29.217 --> 00:08:31.052
Yes, that's it!

00:08:31.052 --> 00:08:35.056
You're doing great. That's it!

00:08:37.475 --> 00:08:40.812
Good! One... Two...

00:08:40.812 --> 00:08:44.482
Three... Four... Five!

00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:46.860
Okay, come up.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.905
Good. One more time! Lower your head.

00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:54.659
One... Two... Three...

00:08:54.659 --> 00:08:55.952
Yes, yes!

00:08:55.952 --> 00:08:57.203
Four...

00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:59.956
--That's it.
--Five...

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:03.126
You've really improved.

00:09:15.764 --> 00:09:17.766
Oh, no!

00:09:18.683 --> 00:09:20.310
Felli!

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.646
I swear.

00:09:23.646 --> 00:09:25.648
I thought I was going to die.

00:09:25.648 --> 00:09:27.025
"Niina" "Helli"
Look, I'm sorry.

00:09:27.025 --> 00:09:30.487
"Haarey"
Still! Now you can float in the water!

00:09:30.487 --> 00:09:33.907
No, I think that's
something different altogether.

00:09:34.741 --> 00:09:36.910
"Layhon"
Yo, stud man.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:39.954
"Layhon"
You okay lettin' the little lady go on home?

00:09:39.954 --> 00:09:42.791
"Layhon"
No, it's not like that.

00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:45.543
This food looks great.

00:09:46.044 --> 00:09:46.961
By the way, what is <i>this</i>?

00:09:46.961 --> 00:09:48.380
"Niina" "Helli"
By the way, what is <i>this</i>?

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.215
"Niina" "Helli"
An ancient writing system.

00:09:50.215 --> 00:09:51.675
"Helli"
Oh...

00:09:53.051 --> 00:09:55.178
That girl...

00:09:55.178 --> 00:09:58.014
Is she now able to swim?

00:09:58.223 --> 00:10:00.517
Yeah. Just a little.

00:10:00.517 --> 00:10:02.352
I see.

00:10:06.064 --> 00:10:08.108
What's the matter, Layfon?

00:10:08.108 --> 00:10:10.568
No, it's nothing...

00:10:15.407 --> 00:10:18.410
We store our valuables over there.

00:10:18.827 --> 00:10:21.413
We'll keep your dites for you.

00:10:21.413 --> 00:10:24.249
So, Biggie's in one of those?

00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:27.252
Time's runnin' out.

00:10:29.004 --> 00:10:33.758
Let me give Big Boy his birthday present.

00:10:40.557 --> 00:10:42.767
What happened?!

00:10:59.242 --> 00:11:00.285
It shut off.

00:11:00.285 --> 00:11:02.120
Put some more money in it.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.788
Huh?! <i>Me</i>?

00:11:03.788 --> 00:11:05.749
Reckon I wanna keep watchin'!

00:11:05.749 --> 00:11:07.959
All right, fine.

00:11:08.918 --> 00:11:14.299
This herbal, low-frequency
bath really loosens the muscles!

00:11:15.675 --> 00:11:19.804
It's the low-frequency electricity that does it.

00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:22.432
You might feel a bit of a prick the first time,

00:11:22.432 --> 00:11:25.226
but once you get used to it,
it feels really good.

00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:28.480
Y-You know a lot about this, don't you?

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:31.483
I come here a lot when I have free time.

00:11:31.483 --> 00:11:35.320
I know your secret, why you're
needlessly enthusiastic.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:37.364
"Needlessly"? What are you...?

00:11:37.364 --> 00:11:40.450
Was it really a coincidence?

00:11:41.159 --> 00:11:42.994
W-Was what?

00:11:42.994 --> 00:11:45.705
You and the others coming here.

00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:49.668
I doubt Sharnid would
spend his time off with <i>you</i>, ma'am.

00:11:49.668 --> 00:11:51.836
Ah. He...

00:11:51.836 --> 00:11:54.297
That's it! The pool! The pool!

00:11:54.297 --> 00:11:57.092
I said I was going to the pool,
and he tagged along!

00:11:57.092 --> 00:12:00.303
His real objective was girls
in bikinis! Oh, that man!

00:12:00.303 --> 00:12:02.931
True enough...

00:12:05.767 --> 00:12:08.895
I'm telling you, this all happened for a reason.

00:12:08.895 --> 00:12:13.858
And I'll be right there with you,
till you're able to swim!

00:12:16.444 --> 00:12:18.446
H-Hey!

00:12:18.571 --> 00:12:20.573
Felli!

00:12:29.249 --> 00:12:32.460
This was a terrible day.

00:12:45.432 --> 00:12:48.059
I think we'll be discovered.

00:12:49.019 --> 00:12:50.645
Huh?

00:12:51.312 --> 00:12:53.356
It will be all right.

00:12:54.983 --> 00:12:55.984
Probably...

00:12:55.984 --> 00:12:59.988
You have to... more careful, ma'am.

00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:03.992
You aren't doing... thing at all,
so why don't you shut it?!

00:13:03.992 --> 00:13:08.872
Now, now. We still have...
agreement don't we, Mr. President?

00:13:08.872 --> 00:13:12.250
Rest easy. I know.

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:15.545
Tomorrow, I'll be more...

00:13:21.885 --> 00:13:24.054
<i>What I heard last night</i>...

00:13:24.054 --> 00:13:26.806
<i>What was that</i>?

00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:30.935
Oh, Mr. President!

00:13:30.935 --> 00:13:32.562
<i>Ridiculous</i>!

00:13:32.562 --> 00:13:34.397
<i>There is no way my brother</i>
<i>and the rest of the unit</i>

00:13:34.397 --> 00:13:36.941
<i>would be meeting at that hour.</i>

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:39.110
<i>It must have been a dream</i>.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.862
Now then, Felli!

00:13:40.862 --> 00:13:43.239
Let's give it our all today as well!

00:13:43.239 --> 00:13:44.115
No.

00:13:44.115 --> 00:13:49.120
Come on! You have to!
You have to swim or else--

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.664
Nothing at all! Nothing at all!

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:53.958
<i>hrfing a hall</i>!

00:13:54.376 --> 00:13:56.836
She certainly is a nice person.

00:13:56.836 --> 00:14:00.632
Being so passionate about
teaching Senior Felli to swim.

00:14:00.632 --> 00:14:02.676
Yeah, a nice person...

00:14:02.676 --> 00:14:04.302
Felli-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:04.803 --> 00:14:07.972
What if Layfon taught you today?

00:14:07.972 --> 00:14:10.892
With a different teacher,
you'll have a different attitude!

00:14:10.892 --> 00:14:12.477
What do you say, Layfon?

00:14:12.477 --> 00:14:14.604
It's fine by me.

00:14:16.231 --> 00:14:17.857
Um...

00:14:31.246 --> 00:14:32.997
Oh, gumdrops!

00:14:32.997 --> 00:14:34.541
I guess we were too late...

00:14:34.541 --> 00:14:36.167
Oh...

00:14:46.886 --> 00:14:49.723
What'cha lookin' all unenthused about, hm?

00:14:52.142 --> 00:14:53.768
I'm not--!

00:14:53.768 --> 00:15:00.233
What's the harm? You're
<i>always </i>training alone with Layfon.

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:03.445
You gotta let someone else have a chance.

00:15:03.903 --> 00:15:05.530
Restoration.

00:15:11.745 --> 00:15:15.331
You've really gotten the hang of this.

00:15:15.331 --> 00:15:17.542
You're doing well.

00:15:20.003 --> 00:15:22.297
Maybe you should try it by yours--

00:15:22.297 --> 00:15:25.258
I-I do not have the hang of this!

00:15:25.258 --> 00:15:27.802
If you release my hand, I will drown.

00:15:27.802 --> 00:15:29.179
You'll be fine.

00:15:29.179 --> 00:15:31.097
No! It's impossible!

00:15:31.097 --> 00:15:34.559
I cannot do it! I will die!

00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:38.563
Oh, really? In that case...

00:15:39.773 --> 00:15:42.776
Shall we continue?

00:15:57.791 --> 00:15:59.292
I will see you again later.

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:00.919
All right.

00:16:03.463 --> 00:16:06.424
Layfon-<i>san</i>. The president summons you.

00:16:06.424 --> 00:16:09.344
May we have a moment of your time?

00:16:09.344 --> 00:16:10.970
Okay...

00:16:25.652 --> 00:16:26.569
Um...

00:16:26.569 --> 00:16:31.449
The president? Where is...?

00:16:31.449 --> 00:16:33.868
What are you doing?

00:16:34.536 --> 00:16:37.956
You can't escape, Layfon-<i>kun</i>.

00:16:41.001 --> 00:16:42.502
Mr. President!

00:16:42.502 --> 00:16:47.799
This is an emergency shelter
built beneath the resort facility.

00:16:49.843 --> 00:16:51.845
Even if trampled by average contaminoids,

00:16:51.845 --> 00:16:54.431
it would not be destroyed.

00:16:54.431 --> 00:16:57.225
Why am I here, in this place?

00:16:57.225 --> 00:16:59.519
There is something I wish to ask you.

00:16:59.519 --> 00:17:02.522
<i>Me</i>? What is it?

00:17:03.231 --> 00:17:04.733
You...

00:17:04.733 --> 00:17:05.358
Yes?

00:17:05.358 --> 00:17:10.822
You and Felli... Just what
sort of relationship do you share?!

00:17:10.822 --> 00:17:16.453
It seems the shadows of many women
can be seen looming over you, and if...

00:17:16.453 --> 00:17:20.874
<i>If </i>you do anything to hurt Felli...

00:17:22.542 --> 00:17:24.210
I shall...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.045
crush you!

00:17:25.045 --> 00:17:28.923
Um... J-Just what are you talking about?!

00:17:28.923 --> 00:17:30.675
I'll say this in advance:

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:34.095
I will not be underestimated!

00:17:34.095 --> 00:17:36.765
If I wish it,

00:17:36.765 --> 00:17:39.976
having the sleeves of
your uniform match your arms,

00:17:39.976 --> 00:17:43.396
arranging a fight between two
new students at the entrance ceremony,

00:17:43.396 --> 00:17:49.611
or having you enter the 17th
Platoon is mere child's play!!

00:17:50.195 --> 00:17:53.281
So you were behind all that after all?!

00:17:53.281 --> 00:17:57.952
Uh, I'm saying that I <i>could </i>do
those things. That's all.

00:17:57.952 --> 00:18:00.372
But you did, didn't you?

00:18:01.164 --> 00:18:06.586
In any case! If anything
happens to cause Felli sadness...

00:18:07.003 --> 00:18:13.093
Layfon-<i>kun</i>... I... You... Yes, <i>you</i>...!

00:18:13.093 --> 00:18:16.721
Listen! I have no idea what this...

00:18:20.058 --> 00:18:24.479
Well now, I wonder
what tonight's dinner will be.

00:18:28.274 --> 00:18:31.528
Get those hands up! You're all hostages!

00:18:33.905 --> 00:18:35.615
Don't make any funny moves!

00:18:35.615 --> 00:18:36.533
--Ma'am?
--Try anything and I'll kill ya!

00:18:36.533 --> 00:18:38.243
--Felli.
--Keep your hands in the air and get over here!

00:18:38.243 --> 00:18:40.078
You there, too!

00:18:46.459 --> 00:18:49.754
You're completely surrounded!

00:18:49.754 --> 00:18:55.468
We have your friends,
as well as the data chips you stole!

00:18:55.468 --> 00:18:58.930
Resistance is futile! Just give yourself up!

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.765
We've got hostages in here!

00:19:00.765 --> 00:19:05.770
We want a guarantee of safety
till we're out of here on a roaming bus!

00:19:10.025 --> 00:19:13.945
Dammit! Our dites are in safekeeping.

00:19:13.945 --> 00:19:15.822
I will look for them.

00:19:15.822 --> 00:19:17.449
Felli...

00:19:17.615 --> 00:19:19.034
Felli, don't!

00:19:19.034 --> 00:19:23.872
At this range, I will not have
to use very strong nen'i.

00:19:23.872 --> 00:19:26.624
There is no fear of my being discovered.

00:19:27.125 --> 00:19:30.795
No, Felli! Right now, you're...

00:19:30.795 --> 00:19:32.422
Felli!

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:36.968
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:19:36.968 --> 00:19:38.470
What is this?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:40.055
She's a nen'i operator!

00:19:40.055 --> 00:19:42.265
Right. Forty degrees.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.317
Restoration!

00:20:08.166 --> 00:20:08.958
Good work, Sharnid.

00:20:08.958 --> 00:20:09.834
"Shanit"
Good work, Sharnid.

00:20:09.834 --> 00:20:11.336
Thank goodness!

00:20:11.336 --> 00:20:13.338
We're saved!

00:20:16.424 --> 00:20:18.468
All right, come on!

00:20:19.344 --> 00:20:20.970
You knew, didn't you?

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:23.640
Huh?! Uh, wh-what are you talking about?

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.684
Uh, beats me!

00:20:25.684 --> 00:20:27.811
The president told us.

00:20:27.811 --> 00:20:29.270
Sharnid, you idiot!

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.481
We can't hide it anymore!

00:20:31.815 --> 00:20:33.066
Um...

00:20:33.066 --> 00:20:36.903
Your nen'i has been incredible
since you were young, right?

00:20:36.903 --> 00:20:38.655
And there've been times when your nen'i

00:20:38.655 --> 00:20:41.866
continually discharges
without you noticing, right?

00:20:41.866 --> 00:20:45.036
For a nen'i operator,
it's kinda like wettin' the bed, huh?

00:20:45.036 --> 00:20:50.333
That's when I was younger.
It should not have happened recently.

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:54.129
It's happened again. Without you realizing it.

00:20:54.129 --> 00:20:57.799
That... It was real, wasn't it?

00:20:57.799 --> 00:21:00.552
The president said that if your body were tired,

00:21:00.552 --> 00:21:03.388
your nen'i would probably weaken, so...

00:21:03.388 --> 00:21:06.641
You were bribed, weren't you?

00:21:07.434 --> 00:21:12.105
I'm sorry! He said he'd give
the platoon a special budget!

00:21:12.105 --> 00:21:15.316
I wanted to make some new dites!

00:21:15.316 --> 00:21:20.071
And I was like, "If I can hang
out with chicks in bikinis, then yeah."

00:21:20.405 --> 00:21:23.158
Did Layfon know about this?

00:21:23.158 --> 00:21:26.244
Nah, we didn't tell Layfon.

00:21:27.078 --> 00:21:31.291
I can't see him bein' able
to put a lie past you, Felli-<i>chan</i>.

00:21:31.708 --> 00:21:33.376
Is that so?

00:21:33.376 --> 00:21:35.712
By the way, where <i>is </i>Layfon?

00:21:35.712 --> 00:21:38.131
Come to think of it,
the president isn't here either.

00:21:38.131 --> 00:21:41.885
And after all that commotion earlier...
Where could they be?

00:21:45.013 --> 00:21:47.223
Now then, you must confess!

00:21:47.223 --> 00:21:51.936
Do you already wish to call me
"brother"?! Is that the case?

00:21:51.936 --> 00:21:53.813
That's the case<i>, isn't it?!</i>

00:21:53.813 --> 00:21:58.401
I'm telling you, I haven't
had a clue what you're talking ab--

00:21:58.401 --> 00:22:00.236
What the deuce?!

00:22:00.236 --> 00:22:02.238
What is this?

00:22:03.198 --> 00:22:05.033
F-Felli?!

00:22:06.534 --> 00:22:09.579
You... Don't tell me!

00:22:09.579 --> 00:22:11.790
W-W-W-Wait! Just wait, Felli!

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:15.251
I-I-I-I thought this was best for you!

00:22:15.251 --> 00:22:16.753
Felli!

00:22:16.753 --> 00:22:18.755
Felli-<i>chan</i>!

00:22:21.383 --> 00:22:23.051
Huh?

00:22:35.271 --> 00:22:38.149
<i>Kioku no hate ni</i>

00:22:38.149 --> 00:22:46.700
<i>Sagashiteita risou no miraizu</i>

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:57.752
<i>Nanika ga kowakute,</i>
<i>wakaranakute, hitori de furuete</i>

00:22:57.752 --> 00:23:08.888
<i>Anata ga miezu ni itsumo aisou waratte </i>

00:23:08.888 --> 00:23:18.023
<i>Kimi no ude no naka dakareteita</i>

00:23:18.023 --> 00:23:23.695
<i>Samete yuku yo ni koi o shite</i>

00:23:23.695 --> 00:23:29.159
<i>Yume no naka made tsurete itte</i>

00:23:29.159 --> 00:23:34.914
<i>Itsudatte kimi wa, itsudatte kimi wa</i>

00:23:34.914 --> 00:23:43.923
<i>Itsudatte boku ni yasashii uso tsuita</i>

00:23:54.517 --> 00:23:58.271
<i>Sharnid was previously</i>
<i>assigned to the 10th Platoon...</i>

00:23:58.271 --> 00:24:04.194
<i>And its leader, Dinn, has still</i>
<i>not forgiven him for his treachery.</i>

00:24:04.194 --> 00:24:06.279
<i>Next time, "A Tender Lie," and...</i>

00:24:06.279 --> 00:24:08.171
<i>Restoration!</i>
